</section>

<!-- ── ELIGIBILITY BANNER ── -->
<section class="layby-eligibility">
    <div class="layby-eligibility-inner">
        <div class="layby-eligibility-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-user-check"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="layby-eligibility-text">
            <strong>Account Required</strong>
            <span>You must have a Qualitick Collections account to be eligible for layby. <a href="/account">Sign up free</a> — it only takes a minute.</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── HOW IT WORKS STEPS ── -->
<section class="layby-steps">
    <div class="layby-steps-inner">
        <div class="about-values-header">
            <span class="section-eyebrow-dark">The Process</span>
            <h2 class="about-section-title">How It Works</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="layby-steps-grid">
            <div class="layby-step-card">
                <div class="layby-step-number">01</div>
                <div class="about-value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Create Your Account</h3>
                <p>Sign up for a free Qualitick Collections account. Layby is exclusively available to registered members — your account keeps track of your payment history and reserved items.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-step-card">
                <div class="layby-step-number">02</div>
                <div class="about-value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Choose Your Watch</h3>
                <p>Browse our full collection and select the timepiece you love. Any item priced at K500 or above qualifies for layby — from everyday elegance to statement luxury.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-step-card">
                <div class="layby-step-number">03</div>
                <div class="about-value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-hand-holding-usd"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Pay Your Deposit</h3>
                <p>Secure your item with a 30% deposit of the total price. Your watch is immediately reserved under your name and taken off the shelf for up to 90 days.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-step-card">
                <div class="layby-step-number">04</div>
                <div class="about-value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Pay the Balance</h3>
                <p>Clear the remaining 70% in up to 3 monthly installments. You choose your own payment schedule — weekly or monthly — as long as it's settled within 90 days.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-step-card">
                <div class="layby-step-number">05</div>
                <div class="about-value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-box-open"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Collect Your Watch</h3>
                <p>Once your balance is paid in full, your watch is dispatched immediately. We ship countrywide across Zambia — delivered right to your door.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── POLICY DETAILS ── -->
<section class="layby-policy">
    <img src="/images/icons/watermark.svg" alt="" class="about-mission-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="layby-policy-inner">
        <div class="about-values-header">
            <span class="section-eyebrow-dark" style="color:rgba(175,144,68,0.8);">The Fine Print</span>
            <h2 class="about-section-title" style="color:#fff;">Layby Policy</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="layby-policy-grid">
            <div class="layby-policy-card">
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Minimum Order Value</h4>
                    <p>Layby is available on purchases of K500 and above. No minimum deposit cap — the more you pay upfront, the less you owe each month.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-policy-card">
                <i class="fas fa-percentage"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>30% Deposit</h4>
                    <p>A non-refundable deposit of 30% of the total purchase price is required to reserve your item. This deposit confirms your commitment and holds the item exclusively for you.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-policy-card">
                <i class="fas fa-clock"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>90-Day Layby Period</h4>
                    <p>You have up to 90 days from the date of your deposit to pay the full balance. Extensions may be granted at our discretion — contact us before your deadline.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-policy-card">
                <i class="fas fa-ban"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Cancellation Policy</h4>
                    <p>If you cancel or fail to complete payments within 90 days, the layby is forfeited. Your deposit is non-refundable. Any additional payments made beyond the deposit will be refunded as store credit valid for 12 months.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-policy-card">
                <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Late Payments</h4>
                    <p>Missed a payment? You have a 7-day grace period per installment. After 7 days we will reach out — if no arrangement is made within a further 7 days, the layby is cancelled under our cancellation policy.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-policy-card">
                <i class="fas fa-tag"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Price Lock Guarantee</h4>
                    <p>The price at the time of your deposit is locked in. If the item goes on sale or increases in price after your layby starts, you pay only what was agreed at the time of reservation.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-policy-card">
                <i class="fas fa-exchange-alt"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Changes & Exchanges</h4>
                    <p>You may switch to a different item of equal or greater value during your layby period — subject to availability. Upgrades require the price difference to be covered. Downgrades are not permitted once a layby is active.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-policy-card">
                <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
                <div>
                    <h4>Item Reserved, Not Delivered</h4>
                    <p>Your item is held securely at our warehouse and will not be shipped until the full balance is settled. We do not release partial-payment orders under any circumstance.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── FAQ ── -->
<section class="layby-faq">
    <div class="layby-faq-inner">
        <div class="about-values-header">
            <span class="section-eyebrow-dark">Got Questions?</span>
            <h2 class="about-section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="layby-faq-list">
            <div class="layby-faq-item">
                <button class="layby-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span>Do I need to pay interest on my layby?</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="layby-faq-a">
                    <p>No. Layby at Qualitick Collections is completely interest-free. You pay only the price of the watch — nothing more.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-faq-item">
                <button class="layby-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span>Can I put multiple items on layby at the same time?</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="layby-faq-a">
                    <p>Each account is limited to one active layby at a time. Once your current layby is paid in full, you are immediately eligible to start another.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-faq-item">
                <button class="layby-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span>How do I make layby payments?</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="layby-faq-a">
                    <p>Payments can be made via mobile money (MTN/Airtel), bank transfer, or any of our supported payment methods. After placing your initial deposit, contact us on WhatsApp or email to record each subsequent payment.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-faq-item">
                <button class="layby-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span>What if the item sells out or is discontinued?</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="layby-faq-a">
                    <p>Once you have placed your deposit, the item is reserved exclusively for you and cannot be sold to anyone else. If an item is discontinued before your layby is completed, we will offer you a full refund — including your deposit.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-faq-item">
                <button class="layby-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span>Is my deposit refundable if I change my mind?</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="layby-faq-a">
                    <p>Deposits are non-refundable as they compensate us for removing the item from sale. However, any payments beyond the initial deposit will be returned to you as store credit, valid for 12 months from the cancellation date.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="layby-faq-item">
                <button class="layby-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span>How do I start a layby?</span>
                    <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="layby-faq-a">
                    <p>Create a free account, find the watch you love, then contact us via WhatsApp or email to initiate your layby. Our team will confirm availability, issue your deposit invoice, and get your reservation started within 24 hours.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── CTA ── -->
<section class="about-cta">
    <img src="/images/icons/watermark.svg" alt="" class="about-cta-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="about-cta-inner">
        <h2 class="about-cta-title">Ready to Reserve<br><em>Your Timepiece?</em></h2>
        <p>Create your account today and start your layby journey. Your dream watch is closer than you think.</p>
        <div class="about-cta-btns">
            <a href="/account" class="btn-hero-primary">
                Get Started
                <img src="/images/icons/Arrow-Icon.svg" alt="">
            </a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-hero-secondary">
                Ask a Question
                <img src="/images/icons/arrow-Icon-2.svg" alt="">
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    // Simple accordion for FAQ
    document.querySelectorAll('.layby-faq-q').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const item = btn.closest('.layby-faq-item');
            const isOpen = btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
            document.querySelectorAll('.layby-faq-item').forEach(i => {
                i.querySelector('.layby-faq-q').setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
                i.classList.remove('open');
            });
            if (!isOpen) {
                btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
                item.classList.add('open');
            }
        });
    });
</script>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
